{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-4","kind":"proposition","title":"相似三角形对应边成比例","englishTitle":"In equiangular triangles the sides about the equal angles are proportional, and those are corresponding sides which subtend the equal angles.","book":6,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","contentId":"euclid-6-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ffadb136bf5022357fb22d4ec117d473376aca189cbfd4fb0482e61ff19f354","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-4.statement","euclid-6-4.construction.1","euclid-6-4.construction.2","euclid-6-4.proof.1","euclid-6-4.construction.3","euclid-6-4.proof.2","euclid-6-4.proof.3","euclid-6-4.proof.4","euclid-6-4.proof.5","euclid-6-4.proof.6","euclid-6-4.proof.7","euclid-6-4.proof.8","euclid-6-4.proof.9","euclid-6-4.conclusion","euclid-6-4.historical.1","euclid-6-4.historical.2","euclid-6-4.historical.3","euclid-6-4.historical.4","euclid-6-4.historical.5","euclid-6-4.historical.6","euclid-6-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc41960d6788e5bbf63f21d32253468a7cdfaf252f7950f9a8ec4c13cd8f284d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equiangular triangles the sides about the equal angles are proportional, and those are corresponding sides which subtend the equal angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在角角三角形中,角的两边是成比例, 它们是相应的边, 将角的角相向。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡等角三角形其在等角旁之各两腰线相与为比例必等而对等角之边为相似之边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于任何等角三角形，两个邻近相等角的边成比例，并且相等角对面的边是相似的边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56a332ab56e755881801c172ebf144add478e7d4bff22d7eb77e2013265a6e42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DCE be equiangular triangles having the angle ABC equal to the angle DCE, the angle BAC to the angle CDE, and further the angle ACB to the angle CED; I say that in the triangles ABC, DCE the sides about the equal angles are proportional, and those are corresponding sides which subtend the equal angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DCE为角等于角ABC的角形三角形,DCE为角DCE,BAC为角CDE,ACB为角CED;我说,在三角形ABC,DCE中,角相等的两边是成比例,这些是相向的角,是角相向的两边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9da8a359a9ca006a1d2564e9dd6de4c2c741e80f45ebf31f61ab5a71e7d76cd2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BC be placed in a straight line with CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC线直线CE"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2696a708b7b08d38d1b161bde780c7275d1704b21f12d46f7d5b75da4c797f8e","citations":["euclid-1-17","euclid-1-post-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angles ABC, ACB are less than two right angles, [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)] and the angle ACB is equal to the angle DEC, therefore the angles ABC, DEC are less than two right angles; therefore BA, ED, when produced, will meet. [[I. Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABC,ACB角小于2,直角,ACB角等于DEC角,因此ABC,DEC角小于2,直角角;因此,BA,ED角延伸后,将相互相交。 [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)] [[I. Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12c480f20de0a6818d4c1b74c2284c119a2385c928b8255d65bc9f2429d3b8e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be produced and meet at F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F时再延长,再相交"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e34b313c51650865edf4472c082c364a067bcd86e23d23cb0b69b433e67cd997","citations":["euclid-1-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the angle DCE is equal to the angle ABC, BF is parallel to CD. [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,DCE角等于ABC角,BF角等于CD角。 [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69e00b706e533bdb58adf1df9a8d2b72c4e9a1b6055918a34ccdb7c02a7b4a3c","citations":["euclid-1-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the angle ACB is equal to the angle DEC, AC is parallel to FE. [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于ACB角度等于DEC,AC角度等于FE。 [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29d1e8f8a567268982d4913ae216aab960743ff5a6bc58ec27c8978cb36af4fe","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FACD is a parallelogram; therefore FA is equal to DC, and AC to FD. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FACD是平行四边形;FA等于DC,AC至FD。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef19e2b02240887ddc481ec4f196b7c61a8ba7bf8bce9602c8c41ddc725e101c","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC has been drawn parallel to FE, one side of the triangle FBE, therefore, as BA is to AF, so is BC to CE. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC比FE,三角形FBE一面,BA比AF等于BC比CE；BA 与 AF 之比等于 BC 与 CE 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6a97b2b31b0a929c240d437502085ce8ca3f1a09ead87c39ad3a35f099d691c","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AF is equal to CD; therefore, as BA is to CD, so is BC to CE, and alternately, as AB is to BC, so is DC to CE. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AF等于CD;因此,BA比CD等于BC比CE,而AB比BC等于CE；BA 与 CD 之比等于 BC 与 CE 之比；AB 与 BC 之比等于 DC 与 CE 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08d210d09798da452f711fb5a93224745dbb27c27b2f7978e8c59a409c8e75bb","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since CD is parallel to BF, therefore, as BC is to CE, so is FD to DE. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于CD比BF,BC比CE等于FD比DE；BC 与 CE 之比等于 FD 与 DE 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b2a1d9ad7a70f7ab6478e5d9dca30386dc94d673976b3448b99d5b00040fb55","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FD is equal to AC; therefore, as BC is to CE, so is AC to DE, and alternately, as BC is to CA, so is CE to ED. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FD等于AC;因此,BC比CE等于AC比DE,而BC比CA则等于CE比ED；BC 与 CE 之比等于 AC 与 DE 之比；BC 与 CA 之比等于 CE 与 ED 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ca64461e8adfc686beefa4d1fc84dea3d0f37395559a3e790252a1aa78ee977","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then it was proved that, as AB is to BC, so is DC to CE, and, as BC is to CA, so is CE to ED; therefore, ex aequali, as BA is to AC, so is CD to DE. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时起,AB对BC的比等于DC对CE的比,BC对CA的比等于CE对ED的比;因此,在平等的情况下,BA对AC的比等于CD对DE的比；AB 与 BC 之比等于 DC 与 CE 之比；BC 与 CA 之比等于 CE 与 ED 之比；BA 与 AC 之比等于 CD 与 DE 之比。 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"991a6d909c9dacd4a1d8f8b168d13b994f3ece7c9f5c013aa70d7b4aea2f1be2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡等角三角形其在等角旁之各两腰线相与为比例必等而对等角之边为相似之边"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于任何等角三角形，两个邻近相等角的边成比例，并且相等角对面的边是相似的边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c26a6a78205dfd3137ef13237e296722eac241541769493d715ddc5c3bc2e855","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁丙戊两角形等角者甲乙丙与丁丙戊甲丙乙与丁戊丙乙甲丙与丙丁戊每相当之各角俱等也题言甲乙与乙丙之比例若丁丙与丙戊甲乙与甲丙若丁丙与丁戊甲丙与乙丙若丁戊与丙戊而每对等角之边各相似相似者谓各前各后率各对本形之相当等角论曰试并置两角形令乙丙丙戊两底为一直线而丁丙戊为甲乙丙之外角其甲乙丙甲丙乙两角既小于两直角〈一卷廿七〉丁戊丙与甲丙乙两角又等即乙戊两角亦小于两直角而乙甲戊丁两线引出之必相遇〈一卷界说十一〉即作两线令遇于己其丁丙戊外角与甲乙丙内角既等即丁丙与己乙为平行线〈一卷〉〈廿八〉依显甲丙乙外角与丁戊丙内角既等即甲丙与己戊亦平行线〈一卷廿八〉而甲己丁丙为平行线方行则甲己与丁丙两线等也甲丙与己丁两线等也〈一卷卅四〉夫乙戊己角形内之甲丙线既与己戊边平行即甲乙与等甲己之丁丙之比例若乙丙与丙戊也〈本篇二〉更之即甲乙与乙丙若丁丙与丙戊也〈五卷十六〉又乙戊己角形内之丁丙线既与己乙边平行即乙丙与丙戊之比例若等己丁之甲丙与丁戊也〈本篇二〉更之即乙丙与甲丙若丙戊与丁戊也〈五卷十六〉甲乙与乙丙既若丁丙与丙戊而乙丙与甲丙又若丙戊与丁戊平之即甲乙与甲丙若丁丙与丁戊也〈五卷廿二〉一系凡角形内之直线与一边平行而截一分为角形必与全形相似如上甲乙丙角形作丁戊直线与乙丙平行而截一分为甲丁戊角形必与甲乙丙全形相似何者甲丁戊外角与甲乙丙内角等甲戊丁外角亦与甲丙乙内角等〈一卷廿九〉甲角又同即两形相似而各等角旁两边之比例等〈本题〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁丙戊，这两个三角形是等角的。甲乙丙 和 丁丙戊甲丙乙 以及 丁戊丙乙甲丙 和 丙丁戊 各自有相等的角。命题解释：甲乙 与 乙丙 的比例如下：如果 丁丙 和 丙戊甲乙 以及 甲丙，如果 丁丙 和 丁戊甲丙 以及 乙丙，如果 丁戊 和 丙戊，则每一对相等角的边是相似的，据说每个前后比等于原形的相应相等角。证明如下：尝试把两个三角形并排放置，使得 乙丙丙戊 的底边呈直线，丁丙戊 是 甲乙丙 的外角。甲乙丙甲丙乙 的两个角都小于两个直角 〈一卷廿七〉丁戊丙，而 甲丙乙 的两个角相等，意味着 乙戊 的两个角也小于两个直角。当从 乙甲戊丁 引出两条线时，它们必须相交。〈一卷界说十一〉 被制作成两条线，使它们在 己 相交。丁丙戊 的外角与 甲乙丙 的内角相等，意味着 丁丙 和 己乙 是平行线。根据此 〈一卷〉〈廿八〉，甲丙乙 和 丁戊丙 的外角相等，意味着 甲丙 和 己戊 是平行线。如果 甲己丁丙 平行，则 甲己 和 丁丙 相等，甲丙 和 己丁 相等。〈一卷卅四〉 和 乙戊己 是三角形。甲丙 内部的线与 己戊 边平行，即 甲乙 与 甲己 的比例。如果 乙丙 和 丙戊 是 乙丙，则 甲乙 和 乙丙，如果 丁丙 和 丙戊 是 〈五卷十六〉，则 乙戊己 与 己乙 边平行，即 乙丙 与 丙戊 的比例。如果 甲丙 和 丁戊 等于 甲丙，则 是 乙丙 和 甲丙；如果 丙戊 是 丁戊 〈五卷十六〉甲乙 乙丙 和 乙丙，则 丁丙 和 丙戊 以及 甲丙，如果 丙戊 和 丁戊 水平，则 等于 .2 和 甲丙，如果 丁丙 和 丁戊 也为 〈五卷廿二〉，同一系列：每当三角形内部的一条线平行于一条边并将三角形分割时，该三角形必须在整体形状上相似。例如，甲乙丙 是一个三角形如 丁戊，一条平行于 乙丙 的线将其分割成一部分。甲丁戊 三角形必须与 甲乙丙 相似。0090。为什么 甲丁戊 的外角等于 甲乙丙 的内角？甲戊丁 外角也等于 甲丙乙 的内角 〈一卷廿九〉甲，即两个形状相似，但每个相等角旁边的边比例相等。〈本题〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64447162114f02d62515dd69fdb8a7413e9682dc7028fc1fc9b0dd5a11ff349f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"増题：凡角形之内任依一边作一平行线于此边任取一点向对角作直线则所分两平行线比例等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"额外问题：每当在三角形的一边上画一条平行线，并沿该边的任意一点画一条对角直线时，那么两条平行线的比例相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"393b19d65e7373ec55d5850b226ad5752fc6d9e0c77f6b1432400d46899761ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形内作丁戊线与乙丙平行次于乙丙边任取己点向甲角作直线分丁戊于庚题言乙己与己丙之比例若丁庚与庚戊"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：甲乙丙，在三角形0000内画一条平行于丁戊和乙丙的线，然后取乙丙下方的任意一边，取点己并在角度甲处画一条直线。丁戊在庚。命题说明：如果乙己与己丙的比在丁庚和庚戊之间，"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f8d2efbb13d84c834acd50954ac4dc18da18f01b7e7c82650a9c524f1b4d18e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲己乙甲庚丁两角形既相似〈本系〉即甲己与己乙之比例若甲庚与庚丁也更之即甲己与甲庚若己乙与庚丁也〈五卷十六〉依显甲己与甲庚若己丙与庚戊也则乙己与丁庚亦若己丙与庚戊也〈五卷十一〉更之即乙己与己丙若丁庚与庚戊也〈五卷十六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲己乙甲庚丁：由于两个三角形相似，〈本系〉是甲己与己乙的比值。如果甲庚和庚丁相似，则甲己和甲庚为反向；如果己乙和庚丁是〈五卷十六〉，甲己和甲庚相似；如果己丙是庚戊，则乙己和丁庚也像己丙和庚戊。〈五卷十一〉变为乙己和己丙，如果丁庚和庚戊也是〈五卷十六〉，"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"640eef138b1b57b7c6bdab7049f4f888bb2a4b8deb02547f7647dcb3d239ad80","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"又论曰：甲己乙甲庚丁两角形甲己丙甲庚戊两角形既各相似即乙己与甲己之比例若丁庚与庚甲也〈本系〉依显甲己与己丙亦若甲庚与庚戊也平之即乙己与己丙若丁庚与庚戊也〈五卷廿二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"补充证明：三角形甲己乙与甲庚丁相似，三角形甲己丙与甲庚戊也相似。因此乙己与甲己之比等于丁庚与庚甲之比〈本系〉，甲己与己丙之比等于甲庚与庚戊之比。把这两组比例合并，得到乙己与己丙之比等于丁庚与庚戊之比〈五卷廿二〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-4.source","contentId":"euclid-6-4","revisionId":"euclid-6-4@raw-1ffadb136bf50223","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed5cbfb44fcda46d697e4bf8ad4d9dcde5d1019891ec75a7f4be9cfb0739b60a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-4:euclid-1-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-